    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 3 of the Excise (Special Provisions) Act, No. 13 of 1989, I, MangalaSamaraweera, Minister of Finance and Mass Media, do by this Order declare that rate of Excise duty specified in ColumnIII for the item No. 2 and 3 specified in Column I of the Schedule II in the Gazette Notification No. 2044/32 dated09.11.2017 shall be amended as 30% of the payable duty with effect from 23.11.2017.",
